    4 statement: declaration SEMICOLON
    5          | assignment SEMICOLON
    6          | print SEMICOLON
    7          | expression SEMICOLON

    8 declaration: set IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

    9 set: NUMERAL
   10    | ALPHA

   11 assignment: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   12 print: show L_PARENTESIS IDENTIFIER R_PARENTESIS
   13      | show L_PARENTESIS ALPHA COMMA expression R_PARENTESIS
   14      | show L_PARENTESIS ALPHA COMMA expression COMMA expression R_PARENTESIS
   15      | show L_PARENTESIS ALPHA COMMA expression COMMA expression COMMA expression R_PARENTESIS
   16      | show L_PARENTESIS ALPHA COMMA IDENTIFIER R_PARENTESIS
   17      | show L_PARENTESIS ALPHA R_PARENTESIS
