   19 expression: expression PLUS term
   20           | expression MINUS term
   21           | term

   22 term: term MULTIPLICATION factor
   23     | term DIVISION factor
   24     | factor

   25 factor: IDENTIFIER
   26       | NUMERAL
   27       | L_PARENTESIS expression R_PARENTESIS


